# Smoke test for bilibili_fans. wait_ms advances the app main loop, so the
# first screenshot asserts the stable post-fetch render from the fixture
# (12345 -> "1.2w" / 520). The UP action then re-runs the render path with the
# already-fetched run_data and should keep the same values on screen.

app bilibili

wait_ms 400
screenshot 01_initial
assert_no_crash

action UP
wait_ms 400
screenshot 02_with_data
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
